; [1] { ==============================================================================
; [2]   KEdit -- minimal full-screen text editor for k/OS, in K16 Pascal.
; [3]   ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; [4]   Architecture after antirez's Kilo: a row array + cursor + scroll offsets,
; [5]   a render pass via sys_setcursor/sys_clear, and a keypress dispatch loop.
